WEBVTT

00:17.020 --> 00:20.230
Carrying an unshakable air
of class and authority,

00:21.000 --> 00:24.510
my mother raised me with a firm touch
at times and a soft one at others,

00:24.510 --> 00:28.680
and she always commanded respect—
most of all from me.

00:31.830 --> 00:33.510
Mother.

00:34.600 --> 00:36.360
And look at her now.

00:37.190 --> 00:39.850
I made baby clothes for everyone!

00:39.850 --> 00:41.270
Try them!

00:42.120 --> 00:45.260
She is but a shadow of her former self.

00:45.260 --> 00:49.020
Ooh, try them for me!

01:02.750 --> 01:07.960
(The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You)

01:08.790 --> 01:11.630
(Karane
as the Tsundere Princess)

01:11.630 --> 01:13.920
(Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep)

01:13.920 --> 01:15.510
(Hakari
Suggestive Weight-Loss Running)

01:15.510 --> 01:16.760
(Kurumi
Ate all of the school store's bread)

01:16.760 --> 01:18.260
(Mimimi
(Getting ready) Two hours later)

01:19.430 --> 01:21.970
(Nano
Robot that exercises for her)

01:21.970 --> 01:24.390
(Shizuka
Has 365 book recommendations this week)

01:24.390 --> 01:26.690
(Kusuri
Has newly developed drug
that gives you sweet dreams)

01:26.690 --> 01:27.350
(Hahari
Chairperson's Address "Education" and "Love")

01:27.350 --> 01:28.020
(Iku
Has been doing push-ups since yesterday)

01:28.020 --> 01:29.560
(Meme
Customized Plushy- Rentaro-kun)

01:29.690 --> 01:34.400
(Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening)

01:37.150 --> 01:38.820
(Meme-san added ears
and a tail for you!)

01:44.450 --> 01:46.500
(Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening)

02:20.210 --> 02:24.620
H-Hahari-san made baby clothes for us?

02:25.200 --> 02:26.740
I'll try my best!

02:26.740 --> 02:28.620
You're going to tear it!

02:28.930 --> 02:32.500
Kusuri-chan said she has
a Babyfication Medicine.

02:32.500 --> 02:35.570
Also have Reversing Medicine for all.

02:35.570 --> 02:38.190
Perfectly safe experiment.

02:38.190 --> 02:40.130
Look up the word "experiment."

02:40.130 --> 02:46.350
Reversing within an hour of babyfication
puts lethal strain on body, but otherwise...

02:46.350 --> 02:48.000
So it's crazy high-risk!

02:48.000 --> 02:50.140
I'm never wearing that crap, anyway.

02:52.070 --> 02:55.400
I wanna play mommy! I wanna, I wanna!

02:55.400 --> 02:58.900
Play mommy, play mommy! Momomomomomo!

02:59.570 --> 03:01.960
"Gone is the capacity
for coherent speech."

03:01.960 --> 03:05.160
Highly likely that this is
a temporary psychological issue.

03:05.830 --> 03:07.740
Knock it off!

03:08.950 --> 03:11.920
How can you act like this?

03:12.250 --> 03:15.160
You're being so immature
in front of everyone.

03:15.780 --> 03:18.670
Have you considered
how I might feel as your daughter?!

03:20.510 --> 03:21.680
Hakari...

03:22.170 --> 03:25.930
You're right.
I wasn't being considerate of you.

03:30.530 --> 03:31.640
Hakari.

03:31.930 --> 03:34.270
I might be everyone's mommy,

03:34.270 --> 03:38.590
but I'm your mommy first and foremost.

03:38.590 --> 03:40.400
Uh, I don't think she's being jealous.

03:40.400 --> 03:41.750
Hakari.

03:43.290 --> 03:47.910
G-Gotta lighten the mood, aye.

03:48.890 --> 03:52.040
Hey, a kitty cat!

03:52.040 --> 03:54.270
Go fetch!

03:54.270 --> 03:55.070
"Human friend."

03:55.070 --> 03:56.920
"That happens to be a game for hounds."

03:58.060 --> 03:58.780
Urk.

03:59.670 --> 04:04.310
Gah! Why didn't you catch that?!

04:04.310 --> 04:06.230
"Ain't no cat capable of that."

04:10.060 --> 04:12.580
A-Are you all okay?!

04:25.070 --> 04:27.000
They need the baby clothes!

04:27.000 --> 04:30.370
Seeing all my girlfriends naked
would be degenerate!

04:30.370 --> 04:31.490
A gentleman!

04:31.490 --> 04:33.960
There's nobody to keep them in check.

04:37.460 --> 04:42.250
It's almost like we're married
with children. Almost.

04:42.250 --> 04:45.060
My, look at all these kids.

04:45.060 --> 04:47.470
We must have done it so many times.

04:48.520 --> 04:51.120
T-Too cute!

04:53.340 --> 04:56.700
Wow, an angel! There's an angel here!

04:57.630 --> 04:58.480
And here!

04:58.890 --> 04:59.730
And here!

05:00.100 --> 05:00.980
And here!

05:01.410 --> 05:02.230
And here!

05:02.590 --> 05:03.490
And here!

05:04.830 --> 05:05.810
And here.

05:05.810 --> 05:08.400
Those are the real deal!

05:09.640 --> 05:13.320
Anyway, it's not safe to give them
the Reversing Medicine for another hour.

05:13.320 --> 05:15.870
We'll have to look after them until then.

05:15.870 --> 05:18.020
You're right, honey.

05:18.020 --> 05:18.750
What?

05:22.600 --> 05:27.890
They're so cute, I wanna gobble them up.

05:31.350 --> 05:32.640
Shizuka-chan?!

05:33.170 --> 05:34.880
Don't do that, Shizuka-chan.

05:34.880 --> 05:37.020
The rooftop's dangerous.
You have to stay close.

05:38.600 --> 05:40.270
Don't worry. I won't eat you.

05:40.590 --> 05:44.280
There, there. It's all good.

05:51.200 --> 05:52.910
Huh? Kurumi-san?

05:54.660 --> 05:57.930
My, you bad girl.

05:59.920 --> 06:01.690
Good girl.

06:02.450 --> 06:03.670
What's wrong, Hakari?

06:05.510 --> 06:06.920
Hakari?!

06:07.240 --> 06:11.180
No, Nano! No door!

06:11.180 --> 06:13.310
You could hurt your hands.

06:13.700 --> 06:16.060
The most efficient way
to dispose of a perv!

06:20.350 --> 06:22.560
(Reversing Medicine)

06:23.420 --> 06:24.440
Absolutely not!

06:26.930 --> 06:28.810
Can't relax for one second.

06:33.100 --> 06:37.070
N-Not you too, Karane-san! You can't...

06:37.070 --> 06:45.210
We agreed to remain
just friends... in my dream...

06:59.790 --> 07:02.480
Huh? W-Wait...

07:02.480 --> 07:04.470
No fighting.

07:08.210 --> 07:10.990
I said no fighting! Play nice!

07:17.240 --> 07:21.500
H-Huh?! I-I'm not mad!

07:21.500 --> 07:23.250
See? I'm not mad.

07:25.250 --> 07:29.260
Okay, okay. Look, milkers.

07:30.580 --> 07:35.260
I had no idea taking care of babies
was this much work!

07:36.610 --> 07:37.990
Mother?!

07:41.800 --> 07:44.820
I can't play with you
at the moment, Mother.

07:44.820 --> 07:46.500
I'm too busy with these two.

07:46.500 --> 07:50.030
Ow! Ouch! Don't pull on my hair.

07:54.540 --> 07:55.670
Please...

07:56.150 --> 08:00.290
I beg you, please listen to me.

08:03.020 --> 08:05.070
Dere, dere.

08:05.070 --> 08:06.670
Mother?

08:10.820 --> 08:11.920
Oh no!

08:15.460 --> 08:16.550
Rentaro-kun!

08:30.310 --> 08:31.320
So that's it!

08:52.370 --> 08:54.250
They laughed so much, they fell asleep.

08:55.120 --> 08:56.290
They're so adorable.

08:56.290 --> 08:58.800
I think you need medical attention first!

09:00.610 --> 09:02.800
Aw, what an angel!

09:03.740 --> 09:05.140
I see now...

09:05.640 --> 09:08.900
Being a parent must be so much work.

09:10.220 --> 09:14.120
I wonder if Hahari-san felt this way too.

09:15.640 --> 09:21.910
Do you mean all the trouble she went
through raising me as a teenager herself?

09:22.470 --> 09:25.910
No, she told me before...

09:26.850 --> 09:29.450
that you were her shining ray of hope.

09:30.510 --> 09:34.600
I was just thinking, you must've been
like an angel as a baby too.

09:35.320 --> 09:38.440
Mother said that?

09:40.440 --> 09:41.930
Mother.

09:44.660 --> 09:47.310
What is it, Hakari?

09:47.570 --> 09:50.060
Um, you see...

09:51.130 --> 09:53.320
Come on, tell me, Hakari.

09:56.820 --> 09:59.820
Oh, my dear Hakari.

10:11.090 --> 10:13.880
No! This can't be happening!

10:13.880 --> 10:16.330
Why did I turn into a baby too?!

10:16.330 --> 10:20.190
I just wanted to see you all as babies!

10:22.180 --> 10:26.580
Bad news. Hahari's mental age
didn't reverse properly.

10:26.580 --> 10:28.850
"Nay, this is how it's always been."

10:30.390 --> 10:33.440
There's a chance these two
haven't weaned yet, too.

10:34.300 --> 10:35.860
- Like hell!
- Like heck!

10:37.410 --> 10:38.660
Mother.

10:39.880 --> 10:43.470
I apologize for earlier.

10:44.300 --> 10:45.620
Hakari...

10:46.260 --> 10:48.870
No, I should be the one to apologize.

10:49.140 --> 10:52.360
I regret losing control of myself.

10:52.360 --> 10:54.250
Well, you're not showing it.

10:54.530 --> 10:57.050
I should've been more considerate
of your feelings.

10:57.050 --> 10:58.270
No.

10:58.270 --> 11:03.270
No matter how you may act,
you'll always be my mother...

11:04.760 --> 11:07.180
The same mother I love
and respect so much.

11:08.840 --> 11:14.270
Thinking back, I've never seen
Mother look so alive.

11:14.840 --> 11:20.760
Meeting Rentaro-kun has given her
people she feels safe with

11:20.760 --> 11:23.360
and an environment where she feels free.

11:25.080 --> 11:30.030
Go ahead and catch up on all the joys of
youth you missed out on raising me...

11:30.760 --> 11:35.770
Hold nothing back and be yourself, Mother!

11:36.180 --> 11:38.250
H-Hakari...

11:42.310 --> 11:44.330
Thank you, Hakari.

11:44.330 --> 11:46.450
I'm so lucky to call you my daughter.

11:46.450 --> 11:50.980
Oh, got some more Babyfication Medicine
in my spare diapers.

11:50.980 --> 11:52.750
Let's use it right now!

11:52.750 --> 11:55.230
I wanna change your nappies! All of them!

11:55.230 --> 11:57.230
On second thought, tone it down, please!

11:57.230 --> 12:00.990
Too bad! Mommy doesn't have
a take-back policy!

12:03.990 --> 12:06.990
crunch crunch crunch

12:08.990 --> 12:09.750
gulp

12:13.910 --> 12:17.470
Your eyes are so pretty
when you're eating, Kurumi-san.

12:17.470 --> 12:20.070
They shine like emeralds.

12:21.170 --> 12:22.750
Agreed!

12:22.750 --> 12:27.260
O-Oh, please. Nano-senpai's
and Shizuka-senpai's are clearer.

12:27.560 --> 12:31.980
"Hakari-san and Hahari-san's eyes
are matching jewels."

12:31.980 --> 12:33.140
Agreed!

12:33.550 --> 12:37.530
The green of Yakuzen Kusuri's irises
has a calming effect.

12:37.530 --> 12:39.070
Agreed!

12:39.070 --> 12:42.530
Karane got queen-of-jungle eyes. Powerful.

12:42.780 --> 12:44.910
Is that supposed to be a compliment?!

12:45.230 --> 12:50.060
Speaking of eye color,
Meido's eyes are gorgeous too.

12:50.060 --> 12:52.580
Y-You are too kind.

12:53.370 --> 12:56.710
Uh, I've never seen her eyes, though!
She's always smiling gently!

12:57.260 --> 13:00.590
Come to think of it, neither have I.

13:00.590 --> 13:02.220
Don't you live together?!

13:02.220 --> 13:03.970
She's always smiling gently.

13:04.340 --> 13:08.450
"What color are her eyes?"

13:08.450 --> 13:10.470
Meido's eyes...

13:10.850 --> 13:12.060
are rainbow.

13:12.060 --> 13:13.600
What race is she meant to be?!

13:13.920 --> 13:18.140
What? Wanna see! Stop smiling, aye!

13:18.140 --> 13:22.610
I cannot. A maid should always appear
pleased to serve her mistress.

13:23.110 --> 13:26.700
I'll allow it. I haven't seen them
in a while myself.

13:26.700 --> 13:28.370
If you say so.

13:28.690 --> 13:30.080
Your wish is my command.

13:30.080 --> 13:33.880
How'd this bundle of quirks slip
under the radar for so long?

13:33.880 --> 13:34.990
Oh dear.

13:35.990 --> 13:38.370
My facial muscles are disobeying me.

13:38.370 --> 13:40.750
Seriously, how'd you slip
under the radar?!

13:45.500 --> 13:49.890
I've smiled for so long,
they must have become stuck.

13:50.160 --> 13:53.070
I don't want to see a forced smile!

13:54.870 --> 13:57.390
I am profusely sorry.

13:57.830 --> 13:59.630
Are ya crying?

14:00.400 --> 14:02.850
My eyelids will not part.

14:02.850 --> 14:04.030
Nightmare fuel!

14:04.380 --> 14:07.340
As Hahari-sama's personal maid,

14:07.340 --> 14:10.180
disobeying her order
is a deplorable offense!

14:11.890 --> 14:13.030
Begone, eyelids.

14:13.470 --> 14:14.740
I shall fetch a scalpel.

14:14.740 --> 14:16.240
Don't cut them off!

14:16.240 --> 14:19.300
Forget what I said!
We don't need to see your eyes!

14:19.300 --> 14:20.790
As you wish.

14:21.150 --> 14:24.800
Meido's is so loyal,
it's almost scary sometimes.

14:24.800 --> 14:28.030
If she order ya to take cyanide,
what will ya do?

14:28.030 --> 14:29.340
Take it, of course.

14:29.340 --> 14:31.300
That would simply make you an android.

14:31.300 --> 14:32.550
Look who's talking.

14:32.550 --> 14:36.650
Y'know, I've always wondered when I see
closed-eyes characters in manga...

14:36.650 --> 14:39.440
How are you able to see like that?

14:39.440 --> 14:43.220
What gives you the impression
that I can see?

14:43.220 --> 14:44.690
So you can't?!

14:44.690 --> 14:46.860
How do you even live?!

14:46.860 --> 14:48.860
By hearing and sensing things.

14:53.370 --> 14:54.530
Huh?

14:54.530 --> 14:56.490
Why'd a flower pot fall out the sky?!

14:56.930 --> 15:00.340
Are you all right, Aijo-sama?

15:00.340 --> 15:03.500
Y-Yes, thank you very much.

15:03.940 --> 15:07.450
She's amazing.
She did that with her eyes closed.

15:07.450 --> 15:09.530
Again, somebody explain the pot!

15:09.530 --> 15:13.420
Still wanna see them
rainbow eyes, though, aye!

15:19.020 --> 15:20.020
"Boo."

15:34.160 --> 15:35.480
Whoa, that startled me!

15:35.480 --> 15:37.160
And you startled me! What was that for?!

15:37.420 --> 15:41.230
Oh, was Shizuka-san trying
to startle Meido-san?

15:41.230 --> 15:43.420
And get her to open her eyes?!

15:48.670 --> 15:51.170
Shizuka-chan is too cute!

15:51.450 --> 15:52.930
In that case...

15:53.260 --> 15:56.590
Melt-Ya-Face-Off Medicine!

15:56.590 --> 15:58.060
I told you, you are not using that!

15:58.540 --> 16:01.350
If Hahari-sama orders me
to be sprayed with it, I will.

16:01.830 --> 16:04.310
I would never! That is terrifying!

16:04.690 --> 16:08.500
Announcing these actions
beforehand is ineffective.

16:10.570 --> 16:13.320
Huh... Nano, what are you thinking?

16:13.700 --> 16:16.300
One must catch the target unawares.

16:20.890 --> 16:24.570
Thank you for everything, Hahari-sama.

16:24.570 --> 16:25.460
She's unfazed!

16:25.740 --> 16:29.400
A maid must never leave her master
without expressing her gratitude.

16:29.400 --> 16:31.460
That's not fealty,
it's pure, unadulterated fear!

16:31.870 --> 16:33.450
It was an act.

16:33.450 --> 16:35.220
Before stabbing her,

16:35.570 --> 16:36.970
I retracted the blade.

16:39.730 --> 16:41.170
Shizuka-senpai?!

16:41.170 --> 16:42.480
She started crying!

16:43.590 --> 16:46.060
Y-Yoshimoto Shizuka...

16:46.060 --> 16:47.610
I didn't mean to...

16:50.680 --> 16:54.040
No... Nobody's in the wrong here!

16:54.040 --> 16:57.950
Sheesh. Getting her to open
her eyes should be easy.

16:57.950 --> 16:58.870
Kurumi?

16:59.470 --> 17:00.240
Here.

17:00.650 --> 17:02.580
Try this sweet bun.

17:03.750 --> 17:05.680
Go ahead.

17:05.680 --> 17:07.370
What are you, a dog?

17:08.130 --> 17:10.270
Gladly, then.

17:11.260 --> 17:13.490
A sweet bun to open her eyes?

17:13.490 --> 17:17.550
What's in there, wasabi? Tabasco?

17:17.550 --> 17:20.670
Thank you. That was delicious.

17:20.670 --> 17:22.140
It was delicious?!

17:22.460 --> 17:23.600
But why?

17:24.610 --> 17:27.780
Yummy food should make
your eyes snap wide open!

17:27.780 --> 17:29.400
That's just you!

17:29.640 --> 17:35.840
I have heard that good food and good times
can make people open their eyes wide.

17:35.840 --> 17:38.570
What makes you happy, Meido-san?

17:38.570 --> 17:41.870
Hahari-sama's happiness is my happiness.

17:41.870 --> 17:44.030
And what makes Mother happy?

17:44.030 --> 17:47.420
Getting cozy with Rentaro-chan
and the rest of you.

17:47.850 --> 17:49.370
I see...

17:50.420 --> 17:53.900
Okay, Karane-san. Go get cozy with Mother.

17:53.900 --> 17:55.550
Why don't you do it?!

17:55.840 --> 17:59.450
Uh, but that would be incest, you know?

17:59.450 --> 18:01.050
How far are we going, here?

18:01.050 --> 18:03.930
Come to me, Karane-chan.

18:03.930 --> 18:06.320
Are you stupid? Why would I ever?!

18:06.320 --> 18:08.450
Quit pushing me, you stupid daughter!

18:09.290 --> 18:10.190
Oh...

18:11.190 --> 18:13.820
She smells just like Hakari...

18:17.820 --> 18:20.570
I can't believe you were
actually going to do it!

18:21.000 --> 18:23.330
What do you want me to do?!

18:23.630 --> 18:27.490
Hakari, I know you're jealous,
but you shouldn't throw her.

18:27.490 --> 18:29.460
No! I-I-I wasn't!

18:30.530 --> 18:33.840
I was so close! This is too cruel!

18:35.090 --> 18:37.970
We'll get cozy with you, aye.

18:37.970 --> 18:39.450
"Cheer up, will you?"

18:39.450 --> 18:42.290
Whoo! Little girl burger!

18:42.290 --> 18:44.850
Hahari-sama looks so happy.

18:45.610 --> 18:49.380
Startling her didn't work,
nor did making her happy.

18:49.380 --> 18:52.360
But everyone wants to
see Meido-san's eyes.

18:53.400 --> 18:54.620
Think, damn it!

18:54.620 --> 18:58.860
It's your job as boyfriend to show your
girlfriends what they want to see!

19:02.110 --> 19:04.280
How about we make her laugh?

19:05.110 --> 19:07.100
But she's been smiling the whole time.

19:07.100 --> 19:07.870
Laugh, not smile.

19:08.290 --> 19:12.040
She might be the type
who laughs with her eyes open.

19:12.040 --> 19:13.760
Only villains do that! What's up, people?!

19:14.400 --> 19:16.920
How would we do that, anyway?

19:16.920 --> 19:19.980
Well, uh... I know!

19:19.980 --> 19:22.140
Let me tell you about a funny mistake.

19:22.140 --> 19:26.140
Kusuri-senpai shared
a brain teaser the other day.

19:26.140 --> 19:29.470
Totoro, Totoro, Totoro, Totoro.

19:29.470 --> 19:30.270
Totoro, Totoro!

19:30.590 --> 19:34.240
What's the slimy food traditionally eaten
for good health on January 7th?

19:34.240 --> 19:35.140
Tororo yam!

19:35.140 --> 19:37.530
Bzzt. It's seven-green porridge!

19:37.840 --> 19:39.650
Tororo yam is eaten on the 3rd.

19:40.770 --> 19:43.470
Stop that!
You're making me crave tororo yam!

19:45.780 --> 19:50.170
Man, now I want to watch it again.

19:50.840 --> 19:52.180
Watch what?

19:52.180 --> 19:53.170
You know...

19:53.630 --> 19:55.210
Tororo ro Tororo.

19:55.210 --> 19:55.920
What?

19:56.350 --> 20:00.920
The teaser made it hard to say
Tonari no Totoro for My Neighbor Totoro right.

20:03.860 --> 20:06.900
Yeah, laughing isn't opening her eyes.

20:06.900 --> 20:08.180
Tororo ro Tororo!

20:08.180 --> 20:10.090
Heh... Tororo ro...

20:11.220 --> 20:13.410
But you know what?

20:13.410 --> 20:14.440
That wasn't me...

20:15.450 --> 20:17.250
- Tororo ro Tororo.
- Tororo ro Tororo.

20:17.250 --> 20:18.230
What?

20:19.020 --> 20:20.860
It was actually Hahari-san.

20:22.700 --> 20:27.620
Krrrack!!

20:27.620 --> 20:29.370
Hey!

20:31.070 --> 20:32.800
Huh? Why?

20:32.800 --> 20:34.400
How'd that get her eyes open?!

20:35.420 --> 20:37.420
O-Oh, you know...

20:37.790 --> 20:41.920
Since her constant smile
is a show of loyalty,

20:42.280 --> 20:47.150
I figured she would also not want
to laugh at her own mistress,

20:47.150 --> 20:49.870
which would force her to stop smiling.

20:49.870 --> 20:51.820
A perfect plan!

20:51.820 --> 20:54.140
Really were rainbow, aye!

20:54.140 --> 20:58.190
Come on, Rentaro-chan.
Forget about that already.

20:59.220 --> 21:00.330
I'm sorry.

21:00.330 --> 21:02.820
But it was so cute,
I can't stop thinking about it.

21:04.490 --> 21:07.500
Ohohohohoho?!

21:07.500 --> 21:12.700
Meido, did you fall in love with
Rentaro-chan's handsome face at first sight?

21:12.990 --> 21:15.330
What? I can totally relate!

21:15.640 --> 21:20.410
The maid really nice, so it be good
to have her in the Rentaro Family, aye.

21:20.410 --> 21:22.640
"I'm with ya on that one."

21:22.640 --> 21:25.160
She always makes the best tea.

21:25.160 --> 21:27.720
She's very helpful all the time.

21:27.720 --> 21:28.660
No.

21:29.450 --> 21:33.550
I could never harbor feelings
for my mistress Hahari-sama's lover.

21:33.550 --> 21:35.600
That would be deplorable.

21:37.160 --> 21:42.520
I will never have a romantic relationship
with Aijo-sama, even if it kills me.

21:43.210 --> 21:45.860
But... Meido-san!

21:45.860 --> 21:50.370
No, Meido.
You must put your feelings first.

21:50.830 --> 21:52.300
As you wish.

21:53.980 --> 21:59.130
Aijo-sama, will you please go out with me?

21:59.560 --> 22:01.880
But... Meido-san!

22:01.880 --> 22:05.710
There was another girlfriend
hidden nearby!

22:05.710 --> 22:11.690
Will you be able to develop a romance with
Meido Mei, for whom loyalty is everything,

22:11.690 --> 22:13.640
Aijo Rentaro?!

22:13.980 --> 22:15.890
I would even be your concubine.

22:16.420 --> 22:18.880
But... Meido-san!
